{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は紅白出演させていただきます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/31/8061663/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう紅白自体は始まってますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな観てるー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂は後半の最初の方ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田を探してね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/31/8061663/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初に言っておくけど\n沈金で言ってた何かしらのサイン的なのは\nしません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段は包み隠さず発言してしまいますが\n普通の人なので穏便にいくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それくらい大事な場所なのよ\nごめんね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あか勝ちたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n今年は紅白で仕事納め"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に家でゆっくりな年明けだ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年一年ありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それだけ伝えたかったので\nちょっと短めですが\nブログ書きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/31/8061663/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よいお年を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/31/8061663/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"輝かしい一年を期待して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}